  "content": "<div class=\"rhc-theme-light rhc-banner\"><div class=\"rhc-banner__content\"><div class=\"rhc-banner__content__message\">We respect your digital privacy. That's why we strictly limit our use of cookies to those that are essential for the smooth functioning of our platform and do not collect private data. For more detailed information, please visit our <a class=\"chakra-link css-spn4bz\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">privacy policy</a>.</div><button class=\"rhc-banner__content__secondary\">More</button><button class=\"rhc-banner__content__secondary\">Decline</button><button class=\"rhc-banner__content__primary\">Accept</button></div></div><div class=\"css-10glazv\"><div class=\"css-86fxs3\"><div class=\"chakra-stack css-dv7l9g\"><div class=\"css-7pf6at\"><div class=\"css-eih3qk\"><h2 class=\"chakra-heading css-13nblxl\">News</h2><p class=\"chakra-text css-ri779b\">Keeping you up-to-date with the latest research and policy developments at the intersection of mental health and climate change. Brought to you by the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"chakra-link css-19rlmqy\" href=\"https://www.imperial.ac.uk/climate-cares/\">Climate Cares Centre.</a></p></div><div class=\"css-1fcf1vr\"><img alt=\"Newspaper illustration\" fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"240\" height=\"300\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcset=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fplasmic%2Fdev_goh%2Fimages%2FhubNewsEventspng.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fplasmic%2Fdev_goh%2Fimages%2FhubNewsEventspng.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fplasmic%2Fdev_goh%2Fimages%2FhubNewsEventspng.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fplasmic%2Fdev_goh%2Fimages%2FhubNewsEventspng.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fplasmic%2Fdev_goh%2Fimages%2FhubNewsEventspng.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fplasmic%2Fdev_goh%2Fimages%2FhubNewsEventspng.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fplasmic%2Fdev_goh%2Fimages%2FhubNewsEventspng.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fplasmic%2Fdev_goh%2Fimages%2FhubNewsEventspng.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fplasmic%2Fdev_goh%2Fimages%2FhubNewsEventspng.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fplasmic%2Fdev_goh%2Fimages%2FhubNewsEventspng.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fplasmic%2Fdev_goh%2Fimages%2FhubNewsEventspng.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\" style=\"color: transparent;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"css-1fjfafe\"><div class=\"css-gforq2\"><div class=\"css-13uul4m\"><div class=\"css-0\"><div class=\"chakra-aspect-ratio css-m9s8ai\"><img alt=\"New Global Research and Action Agenda for Climate Change and Mental Health\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ccm-media/image/upload/v1721744278/GRAA_front_page_half_f12f8a7130.jpg\" class=\"chakra-image css-1wvfyt3\"></div></div><div class=\"css-0\"><div class=\"css-1g4yje1\"><p class=\"chakra-text css-1g4fycx\">23 July 2024</p><h2 class=\"chakra-heading css-1ktppzt\">New Global Research and Action Agenda for Climate Change and Mental Health</h2><p class=\"chakra-text css-11vtjz0\">A Global Research and Action Agenda, published today, identifies research priorities and recommendations to understand and act on the mental health impacts of the climate crisis. ...</p><div class=\"css-17xejub\"></div><div class=\"css-1bvc4cc\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"chakra-link css-spn4bz\" href=\"https://www.imperial.ac.uk/news/254993/climate-change-disproportionately-affects-mental-health/\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"chakra-button css-1cyx8eb\">Read Full Article</button></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"css-17pz0fr\"><div class=\"css-buaox7\"><div class=\"css-0\"><div class=\"chakra-aspect-ratio css-m9s8ai\"><img alt=\"Launch of the Global Research and Action Agenda for climate change and mental health\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ccm-media/image/upload/v1718896061/GRAA_Launch_social_card_39d2c1ef21.png\" class=\"chakra-image css-1wvfyt3\"></div></div><div class=\"css-0\"><div class=\"css-dmmwmi\"><p class=\"chakra-text css-1g4fycx\">20 June 2024</p><h2 class=\"chakra-heading css-11tkle0\">Launch of the Global Research and Action Agenda for climate change and mental health</h2><p class=\"chakra-text css-ktfdu3\">Join us for the launch of the Connecting Climate Minds Global Research and Action Agenda for climate change and mental health!...</p><div class=\"css-17xejub\"></div><div class=\"css-1bvc4cc\"><a href=\"/news/launch-global-research-and-action-agenda-for-climate-change-and-mental-health\"></a><a class=\"chakra-button css-1cyx8eb\">Read More</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"css-17pz0fr\"><div class=\"css-buaox7\"><div class=\"css-0\"><div class=\"chakra-aspect-ratio css-m9s8ai\"><img alt=\"The UWI leads regional dialogue on climate change and mental health\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ccm-media/image/upload/v1716455581/Climate_Change_7d1043f947.png\" class=\"chakra-image css-1wvfyt3\"></div></div><div class=\"css-0\"><div class=\"css-dmmwmi\"><p class=\"chakra-text css-1g4fycx\">24 August 2023</p><h2 class=\"chakra-heading css-11tkle0\">The UWI leads regional dialogue on climate change and mental health</h2><div class=\"css-17xejub\"></div><div class=\"css-1bvc4cc\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"chakra-link css-spn4bz\" href=\"https://www.cavehill.uwi.edu/news-events/news-releases/2023/august/the-uwi-leads-regional-dialogue-on-climate-change.aspx\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"chakra-button css-1cyx8eb\">Read Full Article</button></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"css-17pz0fr\"><div class=\"css-16pjd46\"><div class=\"css-0\"><div class=\"chakra-aspect-ratio css-phzly8\"><img alt=\"New Climate Cares Centre to focus on mental health in the climate emergency\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ccm-media/image/upload/v1716455494/230928_owenbphoto_ighi_climatecares_114_1695990210672_x2_096f1b59b4.jpg\" class=\"chakra-image css-1wvfyt3\"></div></div><div class=\"css-0\"><div class=\"css-dmmwmi\"><p class=\"chakra-text css-1g4fycx\">03 October 2023</p><h2 class=\"chakra-heading css-11tkle0\">New Climate Cares Centre to focus on mental health in the climate emergency</h2><div class=\"css-17xejub\"></div><div class=\"css-1bvc4cc\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"chakra-link css-spn4bz\" href=\"https://www.imperial.ac.uk/news/248094/new-climate-cares-centre-focus-mental/\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"chakra-button css-1cyx8eb\">Read Full Article</button></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"css-17pz0fr\"><div class=\"css-16pjd46\"><div class=\"css-0\"><div class=\"chakra-aspect-ratio css-phzly8\"><img alt=\"Now live! Collaborate Area on Climate Change &amp; Mental Health\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ccm-media/image/upload/v1716542364/Collaborate_social_card_b47951cad2.png\" class=\"chakra-image css-1wvfyt3\"></div></div><div class=\"css-0\"><div class=\"css-dmmwmi\"><p class=\"chakra-text css-1g4fycx\">25 May 2024</p><h2 class=\"chakra-heading css-11tkle0\">Now live! Collaborate Area on Climate Change &amp; Mental Health</h2><p class=\"chakra-text css-11vtjz0\">Sign up to the Global Online Hub and be part of the growing climate and mental health intersection in your region and globally....</p><div class=\"css-17xejub\"></div><div class=\"css-1bvc4cc\"><a href=\"/news/Now-live\"></a><a class=\"chakra-button css-1cyx8eb\">Read More</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"css-1htvg8n\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"chakra-button css-pi8a62\">Load More</button></div></div></div>",
